---
import Icon from '../ui/Icon.astro'
---

<section id="how-it-works" class="py-16 md:py-24 relative">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 md:px-6">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center space-y-4 text-center"
    >
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold font-heading sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl">
          Cómo funciona
          <span
            class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-red-400 to-sky-400"
          >
            KiraKana
          </span>
        </h2>
        <p class="max-w-4xl text-muted-foreground text-lg">
          Nuestro enfoque estructurado hace que aprender los caracteres
          japoneses sea simple y efectivo
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      class="max-w-4xl mx-auto grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 my-6 text-pretty"
    >
      <div
        class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm bg-yellow-50"
      >
        <div class="p-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400">
          <Icon name="learn" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Aprende</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center">
          Estudia los caracteres Hiragana y Katakana con guías visuales claras
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm bg-yellow-50"
      >
        <div class="p-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400">
          <Icon name="practice" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Practica</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center">
          Mejora tu escritura y reconocimiento con un puzzle interactivo
        </p>
      </div>
      <div
        class="flex flex-col items-center space-y-2 border border-gray-200 rounded-lg p-6 shadow-sm bg-yellow-50"
      >
        <div class="p-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-400">
          <Icon name="progress" />
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-foreground">Progresa</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted-foreground text-center">
          Monitorea tu progreso y observa tu mejora a lo largo del tiempo
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
